      "writtenOn": "2018-07-09T20:26:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Same comment here as in the previous flat model. I wonder if this should just be something we keep internally to this module. Do we expect the logic outside of this class to call or rely on this attribute?\n\nIf not, then maybe we should keep it here until we have a good reason to expose it as part of the interface or require all enforcement models to define it.",
